# Allowlist: only the configuration surface is tracked.
# fish writes runtime state (history, etc.) here — reject everything else.
*
!.gitignore
!config.fish
!fish_variables
!conf.d/
!conf.d/**
!functions/
!functions/**
!completions/
!completions/**

# Safety net inherited from the root .gitignore: "!conf.d/**" and friends
# would override it, so repeat it here.
**/*token*
**/*session*
**/*password*
**/*cookie*
**/*history*
